WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.034 --> 00:00:04.645
("Over the Divide" by
Warner/Chappell Production music)

00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:06.747
- I can't say I felt
represented growing up.

00:00:06.747 --> 00:00:08.398
- I think the only Latin character

00:00:08.398 --> 00:00:10.105
that there is in the Disney universe

00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:10.976
is a Chihuahua.

00:00:10.976 --> 00:00:12.730
- I think the Princess and the Frog.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:15.747
I was kinda older so I wasn't
really able get into it.

00:00:15.747 --> 00:00:18.403
- I have faith that Disney's
gonna get there one day.

00:00:18.403 --> 00:00:19.098
And I know that.

00:00:19.098 --> 00:00:21.001
You know, if you need
a Korean male character

00:00:21.001 --> 00:00:23.368
to base anything on, I'm
totally a cartoon already.

00:00:23.368 --> 00:00:26.506
("Over the Divide")

00:00:26.506 --> 00:00:28.419
- So we make you a Korean prince then?

00:00:28.419 --> 00:00:29.632
- That would be excellent.

00:00:29.632 --> 00:00:33.396
So I'm on this mission to
destroy this Fox princess.

00:00:33.396 --> 00:00:35.081
This priestess.

00:00:35.081 --> 00:00:35.475
- Yes

00:00:35.475 --> 00:00:36.948
- And I'm accompanied by my dog.

00:00:36.948 --> 00:00:40.143
- So my prince is a Merman.

00:00:40.143 --> 00:00:42.039
I want to say he falls in love with

00:00:42.039 --> 00:00:46.862
a guy who sings with his guitarra.

00:00:46.862 --> 00:00:48.660
- I feel like if Maya
Angelou and Fran Lebowitz

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:50.296
had a baby, that would be me.

00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:51.073
(laughs)

00:00:51.073 --> 00:00:52.310
- [Voiceover] Should
I put earrings on you?

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:54.350
- Sometimes. I wear them from Claire's.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:56.049
(laughs)

00:00:56.049 --> 00:00:56.851
- Regal.

00:00:56.851 --> 00:00:58.945
A lot of swag.

00:00:58.945 --> 00:01:00.208
Swords.

00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:00.777
- Swords, huh?

00:01:00.777 --> 00:01:03.483
- Sword and black power.

00:01:03.483 --> 00:01:04.819
- [Voiceover] Yep, there you are.

00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:06.463
- He's way cooler than me.

00:01:06.463 --> 00:01:11.463
("Over the Divide")

00:01:20.021 --> 00:01:21.217
- Do I close my eyes?
- [Voiceover] Cover your eyes.

00:01:21.217 --> 00:01:22.229
- [Guy in black shirt] All right.

00:01:22.229 --> 00:01:23.085
- [Voiceover] Open!

00:01:23.085 --> 00:01:23.667
- [Guy with blue shirt] I'm scared.

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:26.809
- (screams) I'm like, I'm too excited.

00:01:26.809 --> 00:01:28.441
Okay, should I? Okay.

00:01:28.441 --> 00:01:32.379
Oh my god! (laughs)

00:01:32.379 --> 00:01:34.486
Oh my god!

00:01:34.486 --> 00:01:35.939
- Oh my god, I love it!

00:01:35.939 --> 00:01:37.475
That is so cool!

00:01:37.475 --> 00:01:41.216
- Holy (bleep). That's (bleep) dope.

00:01:41.216 --> 00:01:43.304
- Oh, hell yeah!

00:01:43.304 --> 00:01:47.500
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.928
- I never really thought
about how much I looked

00:01:48.928 --> 00:01:49.927
like a Spanish (foreign language)

00:01:49.927 --> 00:01:52.533
and there's a little heart on my face.

00:01:52.533 --> 00:01:54.092
Aww, that's perfect.

00:01:54.092 --> 00:01:56.148
Hearts are actually my symbol
that I put on everything.

00:01:56.148 --> 00:01:57.770
- Definitely want to see that as a movie.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:58.768
I gotta picture it now, I got to write it.

00:01:58.768 --> 00:02:01.402
I think for me, when I
started growing my hair out,

00:02:01.402 --> 00:02:02.360
it meant a lot.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.133
'Cause it was like, "oh, this
is completely different."

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:05.501
I get different reactions from people,

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:07.751
and I kind of felt like a strength in it.

00:02:07.751 --> 00:02:08.722
- Dang!

00:02:08.722 --> 00:02:10.273
And my eyebrows on fleek, too.

00:02:10.273 --> 00:02:11.973
- I really love the hat.

00:02:11.973 --> 00:02:15.062
I love the details of the clothes,

00:02:15.062 --> 00:02:18.715
and I'm really just
digging my dog companion

00:02:18.715 --> 00:02:19.715
who also has a sword.

00:02:19.715 --> 00:02:23.654
- I am the first gay,
Cuban Merman of Disney.

00:02:23.654 --> 00:02:25.366
- Thanks, John, this is amazing!

00:02:25.366 --> 00:02:26.872
This looks so good.

00:02:26.872 --> 00:02:28.130
- Not only could Korean
kids respond to this,

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:29.923
but I think a lot of kids in
general would respond to this.

00:02:29.923 --> 00:02:31.769
You could really base
an animated film off of

00:02:31.769 --> 00:02:33.447
on anyone's story or anyone's dream,

00:02:33.447 --> 00:02:36.429
and it could come out into
something awesome and marketable.

00:02:36.429 --> 00:02:38.160
And I think this looks like both.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:43.160
("Over the Divide")

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:44.058
(woosh)

00:02:44.058 --> 00:02:47.572
(squeaky)

